<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken no comment on Fokus.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken no comment on Fokus.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Handelsbanken on Monday declined to comment on media speculation in Norway that the bank could buy Norway's Fokus Bank ASA in order to further its regional ambitions.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't comment on such rumours,&quot; Handelsbanken spokesman Leif Lundberg told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Our purchase of (Swedish mortgage lender) Stadshypotek will not affect our general ambitions in Scandinavia. We usually don't make big acquisitions in our expansion but the growth is rather organic and thereby a little slower.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1008</p>
